Package: pacha
Title: A Flexible Toolkit for ChecklistBank Taxonomic and Ethnobotanical Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcelo F.", "Amores-Palma", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "contacto.envinatu@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0337-0467"))
Description: Provides functions to query the 'Listado de plantas de uso y
    aprovechamiento sostenible en Ecuador' checklist, <doi:10.48580/dgvrn>,
    and generate markdown reports for reproducible workflows. Built
    on the Catalogue of Life Data Package schema, the package can also
    query other ChecklistBank-compatible datasets or local ColDP
    archives, with support for extensible language dictionaries.
License: GPL (>= 3)
